'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[cape]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
Issued by the [[Ministry of Prosperity]] on July 22, 2025,<ref>[https://twitter.com/helldivers2/status/1947583094900363368 HELLDIVERS™ 2 | Twitter]</ref> to [[Helldiver]]s who logged in between May 9 and July 22, 2025.<ref>Discord conversation with AH Support regarding exclusive item eligibility brackets | [https://discord.com/channels/1210060956584124416/1210073264928456764/1496914142777311253 Discord link] | [[:File:Primary_Source_Discord_conversation_with_BVits_regarding_exclusive_item_eligibility_brackets.png|File]]</ref>

== Lore ==
Distributed to all [[Helldiver]]s in recognition of the community coming together in a days-long {{Tooltip|ARG|Alternative Reality Game}} quest to bring [[Station-81]] back online.

